  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1300-r1 (PR #1300, AY.13 doctor team scope). req-qa flagged docs/plans/phase-ay/sprint-AY.13-doctor-team-scope.md frontmatter status: draft as a blocking gate-artifact gap at head 6189ad3f5/98ac5c7d2, on the premise that a doc's own closure field should read 'complete' before QA can PASS. fenix (atm-dev, 2026-09-07T17:08:57Z) clarified this is not sprint-specific: every merged AY-phase sprint doc carries a non-'complete' status value (e.g. 'dispatched') by design/convention in this phase, so it is not a defect unique to AY.13. Recorded here for traceability rather than as an ongoing blocking gate: future QA rounds in phase-ay should not re-raise bare 'status: draft/dispatched' as a blocking finding on its own; if the doc-status convention itself needs to change, that is a phase-level process decision, not a per-sprint fix." ;
