  triage:resolutionNote "fenix landed e1b8c329d on integrate/phase-ay (docs(phase-ay): AY.13/AY.14 rows in project-plan sprint table; sprint docs status dispatched). Verified directly: docs/plans/phase-ay/sprint-AY.13-doctor-team-scope.md frontmatter now reads status: dispatched, matching the phase's established convention for in-flight sprint docs (not 'complete', by design). Closing as a doc-level, phase-wide convention clarification rather than a per-sprint code defect; future rounds should not re-raise the bare status value as blocking." .
